1a:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":["pipelineVoice(","{"," stt, llm, tts ","}",")"]}]," returns a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"VoiceProvider"}]," composable with any of the 8 text ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Provider"}],"s. The LLM is just a Provider — swap ",["$","code",null,{"children":"anthropic()"}]," for"," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"openai()"}]," and nothing else changes. Tools, guardrails, sessions, and tracing all flow through the same conversation engine that powers realtime."]}]
