1d:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"ConversationEngine"}]," is a deterministic state machine —"," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"idle → listening → thinking → speaking → interrupted → idle"}]," — reused by both pipeline and realtime. Barge-in is confidence-gated via ",["$","code",null,{"children":"VoiceActivityDetector"}]," +"," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"InterruptionController"}]," and cancels the in-flight LLM+TTS with an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AbortController"}],"; low-confidence blips (coughs, TV) are ignored."]}]
